  <!-- Top band: real companies we've surfaced roles from. Trust signal that
       implies BREADTH ("not just abstract job board names — real employers").
       Same animation timing as the job-board marquee below so they scroll in
       sync (both `marquee` + `marquee-track` use the same 38s linear loop). -->
